## Third-party code
- Minecraft 1.21.8 source code is located in third-party/minecraft
- These files are of particular note for this mod:
    - third-party/minecraft/net/minecraft/block/SculkSensorBlock.java
    - third-party/minecraft/net/minecraft/block/entity/SculkSensorBlockEntity.java
    - third-party/minecraft/net/minecraft/block/enums/SculkSensorPhase.java
    - third-party/minecraft/net/minecraft/block/CalibratedSculkSensorBlock.java
    - third-party/minecraft/net/minecraft/block/entity/CalibratedSculkSensorBlockEntity.java
- In third-party/netherite-shulkers is another mod I am developing. You can use it as inspiration.
- In third-party/fabric-1.21.8 is current version of fabric api implementation